               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Item refunded unworn and in the original packaging including pr</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Item refunded unworn and in the original packaging including protecions can be exchanged, or be the subject of credit, within thirty (30) days from the date of purchase, upon presentation in person of the purchase ticket. Store credit may only be used at the location that issued it and expires after six (6) months. No refund shall be made. Exchange policy does no apply to personalized  items, special orders and exotic leather items. Exchanges are subject to the approval of the  boutique managment team.</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Please keep this purchase ticket for our after-sales service. P</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Please keep this purchase ticket for our after-sales service. Please understand tat we will not be able to perform  after-sales service for any item that is processed or repaired by any unoficial workshop. For any enquiry regarding our after-sales servcice, please contact our Goyard boutiques.</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
